# Infraon Flow keeps environment configuration per application:
#
#   backend/.env.example   -> copy to backend/.env (Django secret key, database, JWT, CORS).
#                             Read by Django via django-environ. Contains secrets: never commit backend/.env.
#
#   frontend/src/environments/environment*.ts
#                          -> Angular build-time config (API base URL, app environment).
#                             Compiled into the public bundle, so it must never contain secrets.
#
# This root file intentionally defines no variables to avoid duplicated configuration.
